menu "Node reset line"

    config NODE_RESET_GPIO
        int "Brain GPIO driving the node's reset (EN)"
        range 0 48
        default 3
        help
            The brain GPIO wired to the node's EN through an inverting stage:
            HIGH holds the node in reset, LOW lets it run. Firmware on the
            brain drives it LOW from boot (node_reset_release()).

endmenu
